"_score_incr_roic":100.0,"_gate_margin_advantage":0.07612112427111989,"_gp_margin_advantage":true,"_score_margin_advantage":58.7,"_gate_pool_share":null,"_gp_pool_share":null,"_score_pool_share":null,"_gate_rev_durability":null,"_gp_rev_durability":null,"_score_rev_durability":0.0,"_gate_fcf_durability":0.3523110059669361,"_gp_fcf_durability":true,"_score_fcf_durability":100.0,"_gate_margins":null,"_gp_margins":null,"_score_margins":0.0,"_gate_fund_growth":0.012069187378478789,"_gp_fund_growth":false,"_score_fund_growth":12.1,"_gate_shrhldr_yield":0.0008131998673568811,"_gp_shrhldr_yield":false,"_score_shrhldr_yield":12.0,"_gate_share_shrink":0.035390594827911404,"_gp_share_shrink":false,"_score_share_shrink":5.8,"_gate_sbc_dilution":0.07202056464122679,"_gp_sbc_dilution":false,"_score_sbc_dilution":0.0,"_gate_insider_own":0.16364,"_gp_insider_own":true,"_score_insider_own":100.0,"_gate_insider_buying":0.036,"_gp_insider_buying":false,"_score_insider_buying":3.6,"pf":[],"description_full":"Red Violet, Inc., an analytics and information solutions company, specializes in proprietary technologies and applying analytical capabilities to deliver identity intelligence in the United States. It offers idiCORE, an investigative solution used to address various organizational challenges, which include due diligence, risk mitigation, identity authentication, fraud detection and prevention, customer acquisition, and regulatory compliance; and FOREWARN, an app-based solution that provides instant knowledge before face-to-face engagement with a consumer, as well as helps professionals to identify and mitigate risk. The company serves financial services, insurance, healthcare, retail, telecommunication companies, law enforcement and government agencies, collections, law, corporate security, and investigative firms. It markets its products and services through value-added distributors, resellers, and strategic partners; and trade shows and seminars, advertising, public relations, distribution of sales literature, and product specifications and ongoing communication with prospective customers, distributors, resellers, strategic partners, and installed base of current customers, as well as through direct sales. Red Violet, Inc. was incorporated in 2017 and is headquartered in Boca Raton, Florida.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Derek  Dubner | Chairman & CEO | Age 53 | Compensation: $1.1M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 250 people. Revenue per employee of $361K ranks in the below the sector median among Technology peers, improving at 28%/yr \u2014 growing workforce leverage. Each employee generates $115K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $26K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 3\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags elevated compensation governance risk (7/10).","financial_summary":["Red Violet, Inc. is a small-cap technology business with a $1.1B market cap on $90M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +19% over the past three years, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder. Operating margins are expanding by +8.6pp year-over-year, which is one of the strongest signals that the moat is deepening.","Returns on capital run at 5% against a 10% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests.","The business throws off $29M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 32 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 2.23\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","Accruals are elevated at -14.5% of assets, and Sloan showed firms building earnings through accruals rather than cash systematically underperform.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 0.1%, a thin return of capital, and insiders hold 16% of the shares, so management thinks like owners because it is one \u2014 the strongest alignment there is."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Price sits 96% above estimated fair value \u2014 no margin of safety left, and the cushion against estimate error has been bid away (confirmed by 2 other valuation measures)","sev":"red","cat":"valuation","magnitude":0.9644996051230901},{"text":"Low reinvestment-driven growth suggests the compounding engine has stalled","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Significant insider selling (net $4.1M)","sev":"amber","cat":"insider","dollars":-4124204.29},{"text":"Technology sector lagging the market significantly, underperforming by 7% over 3 months","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Elevated sector volatility (35% annualized) adds uncertainty","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Above-average market volatility (VIX 26)","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Late-cycle dynamics increase the probability of a slowdown","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Antitrust and platform-regulation risk \u2014 the larger the network effect, the larger the regulatory target on its back, and a single consent decree can reset the moat.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Cybersecurity liability and talent cost inflation \u2014 a single breach can erase years of goodwill, and the war for engineering talent compresses margins even at scale.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet on this measure","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Red Violet (RDVT) Q3 2026 Earnings Call Transcript","source":"fool.com","link":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/red-violet-rdvt-q3-2026-earnings-c